    <string name="register_consent_heading">How FINORA uses your data</string>
    <string name="register_consent_text">• FINORA stores the income and expense records, budgets, bills and goals you enter, so it can show your spending patterns and a 0–100 money health score.\n• If you allow SMS reading, bank messages are read only on your phone. Only the amount, date, merchant and type that you confirm are sent to FINORA. The full SMS text never leaves your phone.\n• AI advice is created from totals and category names only. Your name, email, merchants and account numbers are never sent to the AI service, and every number in the advice is checked first.\n• FINORA never asks for your bank login. Admin and staff users cannot see your transactions.\n• You can withdraw this consent in Settings at any time. Encrypted backups are deleted after 30 days.</string>
